      "claim": "Direct L1/L2 absolute or systemic F measurements for fluoroquinolone analogs are all at or above the 20% threshold: moxifloxacin 86–97% (C03, C19, C26), trovafloxacin 87.6–88% (C02, C07, C17), levofloxacin/ofloxacin ~100% (C04, C09, C12, C20), norfloxacin mean 40% (C15), and antofloxacin high (C06, C16).",
