      "claim": "L3 oral exposure records for fluoroquinolones show substantial plasma Cmax/AUC after oral dosing (zabofloxacin Cmax ~1889–2005 ng/mL and AUC ~11,000–11,900 ng·h/mL; delafloxacin Cmax 7.16 µg/mL; nemonoxacin oral Cmax 7.02 mg/L close to IV), consistent with high oral absorption.",
